This represents the "who" section of the journal. It contains information about values, profiles, personality tests, and principles.

Don't confuse this with "Knowledge"; this section – Identity – is purely emotional, stemming from positive or negative traumas.

"Knowledge" refers to academic studies or information that you can recall without any cognitive effort.

Recommended: personal/professional identity, purpose, psychological profiles (OCEAN, MBTI, Enneagram, DISC, etc.), and long-term vision.

Avoid: narrative biography (this goes in [[Biography/_doc-biography]]).
